DTSTAMP:20251013T120000Z
DTSTART:20251015T120000Z
DTEND:20251015T133000Z
SUMMARY:Workshop 9: Archiving Session
LOCATION:House of Prominence\, Attic (Top floor)\, Luxemburger Str. 299\, Cologne
DESCRIPTION:Long-term data preservation strategies\, digital archiving standards\, institutional repository usage (UoC guidelines)\, metadata creation\, and legal requirements.\n\nSpeakers: Luke Günther (Project S\, CRC 1252) & Sarah Saleh (Data Center for the Humanities\, UoC)\n\nMore info: https://sfb1252.github.io/talks/workshops/09-archiving-session/
