UID:workshop-12-computational-reproducibility@sfb1252.uni-koeln.de
DTSTAMP:20251013T120000Z
DTSTART:20251126T130000Z
DTEND:20251126T143000Z
SUMMARY:Workshop 12: Computational Reproducibility using R
LOCATION:House of Prominence\, Attic (Top floor)\, Luxemburger Str. 299\, Cologne
DESCRIPTION:Reproducible research workflows in R\, R Markdown and Quarto for dynamic documents\, package management with renv\, containerization\, version control best practices\, and creating reproducible analysis pipelines.\n\nSpeaker: Luke Günther\, Project S\, CRC 1252\n\nMore info: https://sfb1252.github.io/talks/workshops/12-computational-reproducibility-r/
URL:https://sfb1252.github.io/talks/workshops/12-computational-reproducibility-r/
